        "created_at": "2016-02-06T15:03:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Mint. Relatively easy, but a little harry at the beginning since Lady Luck and Inconceivable Obstruction came out early, making it harder to tag her or get rid of either card. Once I nicked the Talisman and Wraith got her eye-piece out, though, both were swiftly taken care of. The Block did a great deal of nothing, aside from a timely Defensive Displacement, and Tachyon getting the self-damaging Jinxes combined with two Glass Jaws worked in my favor thanks to Synaptic Interruption. Also managed to get Kismet to whack herself for 8 damage when Tachyon was holding the Talisman.</p>",
